cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
title: GeoSigma
abstract: >-
  A model-agnostic Python library for generating hydrostratigraphic
  realizations from manually interpreted layer models using geostatistical
  simulation. Includes a variance-map theme engine for combining
  heterogeneous geophysical and borehole data sources into per-layer
  uncertainty maps.
type: software
